This is a '''list of WBO world champions''', showing every world champion certified by the [[World Boxing Organization]] (WBO). The WBO is one of the four major governing bodies in [[professional boxing]], and has awarded world championships in 17 different [[weight class (boxing)|weight classes]] since 1989.

Boxers who won the title but were stripped due to the title bout being overturned to a [[no contest (combat sports)|no contest]] are not listed.

